{"3539360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Full Gear Mong Kok", "steam_appid": 3539360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《Full Gear Mong Kok》 </strong>is a fast-paced action game that combines hack-and-slash with shooting mechanics. Unleash stylish combos and take on uniquely designed enemies—beat them to a pulp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/163f622ee4a4cd54df45c7216af7d9dd.poster.avif?t=1771893093\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/163f622ee4a4cd54df45c7216af7d9dd.webm?t=1771893093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/163f622ee4a4cd54df45c7216af7d9dd.mp4?t=1771893093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious alien fortress from outer space crashes into Earth, releasing a powerful electromagnetic pulse that hacks into the city's robots and takes  over the city! Desperate to find her lost sister, the delinquent girl &quot;Kate,&quot; armed with a high-tech weapon called the &quot;Ciggies Blaster,&quot; fights back against the alien fortress alongside her robot assistant!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Action Combat - </strong>Unleash stylish ground and aerial combos on your enemies!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialized Bullets -</strong> Each with unique effects to take down enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A diverse variety of skill combinations!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge massive bosses in epic battles!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/6365096ae180bcd45551914c94661e48.poster.avif?t=1771893093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/6365096ae180bcd45551914c94661e48.webm?t=1771893093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/6365096ae180bcd45551914c94661e48.mp4?t=1771893093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/ac42b56240223b3c96f64fe043881276.poster.avif?t=1771893093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/ac42b56240223b3c96f64fe043881276.webm?t=1771893093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/ac42b56240223b3c96f64fe043881276.mp4?t=1771893093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《Full Gear Mong Kok》 </strong>is a fast-paced action game that combines hack-and-slash with shooting mechanics. Unleash stylish combos and take on uniquely designed enemies—beat them to a pulp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/163f622ee4a4cd54df45c7216af7d9dd.poster.avif?t=1771893093\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai